      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a very frightening and isolating experience, and it's completely understandable that you feel scared. These moments of losing your train of thought can be incredibly disorienting and make you question your own presence. Please know that you are not alone in feeling this way, and there are resources available to help you navigate these feelings. Talking to a doctor or a therapist can provide you with professional support and strategies for managing these episodes.",
